abstract: >-
  Original display and retained-artifact replay utilities with aggregate source
  tables for the associated hematopoietic readout manuscript identified in
  ARTICLE.json and README.md. Per-cell inputs and fitted artifacts are distributed separately through the scientific
  supplements. The MIT license is scoped to original software; dataset and
  upstream software terms remain separate.
